(987614, 117967, 25921, '<td valign="top">Ha!  This is hilarious.  I love dogs, and I love your high key photo.  I''m sure some will complain that the nose it out of focus, but I believe it adds to the viewer''s focus on the eyes.  It''s like the nose is meant to be blurry precisely because the dog is right in your face!  Well done, I''m gonna go show my wife.  9.  (I always give out one ten per challenge after I''ve voted them all, this is good enough to be it, so perhaps a 10...)  P.S. - A well chosen title.</td>', 'Ha!  This is hilarious.  I love dogs, and I love your high key photo.  I''m sure some will complain that the nose it out of focus, but I believe it adds to the viewer''s focus on the eyes.  It''s like the nose is meant to be blurry precisely because the dog is right in your face!  Well done, I''m gonna go show my wife.  9.  (I always give out one ten per challenge after I''ve voted them all, this is good enough to be it, so perhaps a 10...)  P.S. - A well chosen title.', '2004-11-03 00:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
