(989074, 117461, 5175, '<td valign="top">Definitely love the look of this photo! Reminds me of a spiral staircase, or a DNA strand, or a bicycle wheel even! Nice composition, good contrast, excellent picture. Perhaps it would work better if more tightly cropped (I find the less twisty portion of the tree up top a little distracting) btu thats the best criticism I can make!</td>', 'Definitely love the look of this photo! Reminds me of a spiral staircase, or a DNA strand, or a bicycle wheel even! Nice composition, good contrast, excellent picture. Perhaps it would work better if more tightly cropped (I find the less twisty portion of the tree up top a little distracting) btu thats the best criticism I can make!', '2004-11-03 14:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
