(989084, 118071, 5175, '<td valign="top">I love photos of spiders, and this one DOES look quite odd! :-) I saw a nice 20 ft wide web in a forest nearby, with a big yellow spider in it that I took a photo of .. didnt come out as  nice as yours. Technical limitations are probably the reason why its out of focus, as Im betting you didnt use a true macro lens... also wouldve preferred a tighter crop on the spider itself, or more focus on the spider to make this a better image.</td>', 'I love photos of spiders, and this one DOES look quite odd! :-) I saw a nice 20 ft wide web in a forest nearby, with a big yellow spider in it that I took a photo of .. didnt come out as  nice as yours. Technical limitations are probably the reason why its out of focus, as Im betting you didnt use a true macro lens... also wouldve preferred a tighter crop on the spider itself, or more focus on the spider to make this a better image.', '2004-11-03 14:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
