(989431, 118150, 24962, '<td valign="top">What can I say, Wow...lenticular clouds forming! It is verging on the SFX from Flash Gordon. I love it! Gave you 7, then 9...gotta go 10!!</td>', 'What can I say, Wow...lenticular clouds forming! It is verging on the SFX from Flash Gordon. I love it! Gave you 7, then 9...gotta go 10!!', '2004-11-03 17:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
