(990503, 115990, 28005, '<td valign="top">Aww, how sweet!  I hope you gave them some private time after you took this picture.  ;)  The composition might be a little stronger if you cropped it to be square.  This would also get rid of the distracting yellow leaf along the right side.  Very nice overall, though.  I like the texture of the branch, and how you can see a little bit of the expression on the face of the one to the right.  Also, the leaves being perpendicular to the branch give the photograph a dynamic feel.</td>', 'Aww, how sweet!  I hope you gave them some private time after you took this picture.  ;)  The composition might be a little stronger if you cropped it to be square.  This would also get rid of the distracting yellow leaf along the right side.  Very nice overall, though.  I like the texture of the branch, and how you can see a little bit of the expression on the face of the one to the right.  Also, the leaves being perpendicular to the branch give the photograph a dynamic feel.', '2004-11-03 23:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
