(990867, 117662, 27845, '<td valign="top">This is the fifth time I have to look at your picture. I just love the contarst between the color. Too bad that there''s an orange-brown area below the mushrooms. Luckily most of it is covered by their shadow. It really appeals to me how the mushrooms try to ''break through'' the overwhelming green wood. The contrast is emphasized even more by the difference between the plant''s smooth and the wood''s rough texture. A great shot. 10.</td>', 'This is the fifth time I have to look at your picture. I just love the contarst between the color. Too bad that there''s an orange-brown area below the mushrooms. Luckily most of it is covered by their shadow. It really appeals to me how the mushrooms try to ''break through'' the overwhelming green wood. The contrast is emphasized even more by the difference between the plant''s smooth and the wood''s rough texture. A great shot. 10.', '2004-11-04 05:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
