(991784, 115898, 22011, '<td valign="top">I hope you didn''t tell your model that you''re entering her in a bizarre contest! :-).  Cute, attractive, Beautiful even, I''m not going with bizarre...    This shot looks like a neat portrait, the small size of the copy you''ve uploaded will let it down in the voting though.<br/> <br/>I can just see that she has a really strong eye colour (purple!?) or contacts..  A full sized (640px) image with a tighter crop would be really neat..   Nice lighting, nice pose, and a pretty model, I love the hair and the smile...    Going with a 7...</td>', 'I hope you didn''t tell your model that you''re entering her in a bizarre contest! :-).  Cute, attractive, Beautiful even, I''m not going with bizarre...    This shot looks like a neat portrait, the small size of the copy you''ve uploaded will let it down in the voting though. I can just see that she has a really strong eye colour (purple!?) or contacts..  A full sized (640px) image with a tighter crop would be really neat..   Nice lighting, nice pose, and a pretty model, I love the hair and the smile...    Going with a 7...', '2004-11-04 14:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
