(991933, 116917, 19010, '<td valign="top">very nice color focus and bizzarness. I think if it showed a little less of the stem I would have easily gone up to a 9. great job. one of my top 3</td>', 'very nice color focus and bizzarness. I think if it showed a little less of the stem I would have easily gone up to a 9. great job. one of my top 3', '2004-11-04 15:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
