(992103, 117982, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wow! Are those flamingos? I find this shot extremely interesting. You can sit back and see a great abstract with very nice "S" curves, great texture and wonderful colors, and then lean in and see the reality or detail of water, birds and shoreline. Very creative. Awesome, one of my favs for sure.</td>', 'Wow! Are those flamingos? I find this shot extremely interesting. You can sit back and see a great abstract with very nice "S" curves, great texture and wonderful colors, and then lean in and see the reality or detail of water, birds and shoreline. Very creative. Awesome, one of my favs for sure.', '2004-11-04 17:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
