(994309, 116825, 23141, '<td valign="top">Very cool and certainly bizarre! I love the colors!</td>', 'Very cool and certainly bizarre! I love the colors!', '2004-11-05 22:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(994310, 118103, 23141, '<td valign="top">Laugh!  I love it!  What a great interpretation of the challenge :)</td>', 'Laugh!  I love it!  What a great interpretation of the challenge :)', '2004-11-05 22:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(994313, 117121, 23141, '<td valign="top">Cute, curly, and delicate - good eye, both for the composition and for finding the subject!</td>', 'Cute, curly, and delicate - good eye, both for the composition and for finding the subject!', '2004-11-05 22:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(994316, 117186, 23141, '<td valign="top">Too funny!  Cute shot, clever title, great "expressions".</td>', 'Too funny!  Cute shot, clever title, great "expressions".', '2004-11-05 22:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(994318, 116418, 23141, '<td valign="top">So interesting to look at!  Congrats on capturing this moment in time!</td>', 'So interesting to look at!  Congrats on capturing this moment in time!', '2004-11-05 22:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(994319, 116658, 23141, '<td valign="top">Breathtakingly beautiful, but not necessarily bizarre.</td>', 'Breathtakingly beautiful, but not necessarily bizarre.', '2004-11-05 22:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(994320, 116334, 23141, '<td valign="top">Very bizarre, and very interesting to look at.  Good use of light to show the details.</td>', 'Very bizarre, and very interesting to look at.  Good use of light to show the details.', '2004-11-05 22:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(994324, 117383, 23141, '<td valign="top">Not only are starfish just kind of strange with their regrowing limbs, but you managed to find one with seven legs...  Certainly bizarre!  Plus I like the colors here and the little light-colored things shooting by :)</td>', 'Not only are starfish just kind of strange with their regrowing limbs, but you managed to find one with seven legs...  Certainly bizarre!  Plus I like the colors here and the little light-colored things shooting by :)', '2004-11-05 23:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(994327, 116512, 23141, '<td valign="top">Absolutely and amazingly colorful!  Great capture!</td>', 'Absolutely and amazingly colorful!  Great capture!', '2004-11-05 23:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(994331, 116086, 23141, '<td valign="top">i''ve never seen anything like this...  it''s certainly unique!</td>', 'i''ve never seen anything like this...  it''s certainly unique!', '2004-11-05 23:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(994337, 117679, 23141, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors, but the focus doesn''t seem to be right.</td>', 'Wonderful colors, but the focus doesn''t seem to be right.', '2004-11-05 23:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(994339, 117375, 23141, '<td valign="top">Weird and kind of disturbing - matches the challenge well, though...  The main focus being in the center and the ends being blurry is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Weird and kind of disturbing - matches the challenge well, though...  The main focus being in the center and the ends being blurry is a bit distracting.', '2004-11-05 23:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(994346, 115971, 23141, '<td valign="top">Oh my!  Great capture of the moment, would have been better with less distractions (car, trash can).</td>', 'Oh my!  Great capture of the moment, would have been better with less distractions (car, trash can).', '2004-11-05 23:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(994347, 117976, 23141, '<td valign="top">Bizarre and beautiful.  Nice lighting!</td>', 'Bizarre and beautiful.  Nice lighting!', '2004-11-05 23:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(994350, 115898, 9462, '<td valign="top">wait... I''m confused. How does this have anything to do with nature being bizarre?<br/>Is there something I''m missing? Please inform me.<br/> <br/>She''s cute nonetheless. Lighting seems a bit harsh.</td>', 'wait... I''m confused. How does this have anything to do with nature being bizarre?Is there something I''m missing? Please inform me. She''s cute nonetheless. Lighting seems a bit harsh.', '2004-11-05 23:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(994358, 117493, 26472, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the angle of the shot, becuase the out of focus background distracts me. Your focus is dead one, however, and the exposure is excellent. 7</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the angle of the shot, becuase the out of focus background distracts me. Your focus is dead one, however, and the exposure is excellent. 7', '2004-11-05 23:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(994359, 118039, 23141, '<td valign="top">I like this leaf a lot...  It looks kind of like a shark, if you want scary... and it looks kind of like Stuart Little''s canoe if you don''t want scary.  Nice capture and good lighting.</td>', 'I like this leaf a lot...  It looks kind of like a shark, if you want scary... and it looks kind of like Stuart Little''s canoe if you don''t want scary.  Nice capture and good lighting.', '2004-11-05 23:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(994362, 117813, 26472, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop would improve this photo for me as the clock itself doesn''t take up much space in the shot. Good exposure on this overcast day. 6</td>', 'A tighter crop would improve this photo for me as the clock itself doesn''t take up much space in the shot. Good exposure on this overcast day. 6', '2004-11-05 23:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(994365, 117078, 23141, '<td valign="top">Now, *that* is pretty freakin'' bizarre.  Seems a little grainy and out-of-focus, though.</td>', 'Now, *that* is pretty freakin'' bizarre.  Seems a little grainy and out-of-focus, though.', '2004-11-05 23:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(994368, 116033, 26472, '<td valign="top">The poor guy looks sick with that white discharge coming from his eyes.</td>', 'The poor guy looks sick with that white discharge coming from his eyes.', '2004-11-05 23:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(994371, 117022, 23141, '<td valign="top">I like this - I think it''s pretty clever.  A wider aperture to blur the background out a bit more would have worked even better, IMO.</td>', 'I like this - I think it''s pretty clever.  A wider aperture to blur the background out a bit more would have worked even better, IMO.', '2004-11-05 23:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(994372, 116634, 26472, '<td valign="top">This certainly qualifies as bizarre. Nice work isolating the bizarre lemon. Not an easy task in this very monochromatic setting. 8</td>', 'This certainly qualifies as bizarre. Nice work isolating the bizarre lemon. Not an easy task in this very monochromatic setting. 8', '2004-11-05 23:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(994375, 117941, 26472, '<td valign="top">Creepy, kinda gross. Definitely bizarre. 7</td>', 'Creepy, kinda gross. Definitely bizarre. 7', '2004-11-05 23:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(994377, 117967, 23141, '<td valign="top">Absolutely adorable, I added it to my favorites!  However, I don''t feel it meets this challenge very well...</td>', 'Absolutely adorable, I added it to my favorites!  However, I don''t feel it meets this challenge very well...', '2004-11-05 23:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(994379, 116371, 26472, '<td valign="top">Can''t really tell what''s going on here. Less cropping and a vertical format might have helped.</td>', 'Can''t really tell what''s going on here. Less cropping and a vertical format might have helped.', '2004-11-05 23:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(994380, 117944, 23141, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, but doesn''t really meet my idea of the challenge.  Seems to be a bit blurry as well.</td>', 'Cute idea, but doesn''t really meet my idea of the challenge.  Seems to be a bit blurry as well.', '2004-11-05 23:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(994385, 116342, 26472, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus and composition. Tonal balance is very nice as well. I enjoy the use of B&amp;W in this shot to help isolate the spider. Sublime! 10</td>', 'Excellent focus and composition. Tonal balance is very nice as well. I enjoy the use of B&W in this shot to help isolate the spider. Sublime! 10', '2004-11-05 23:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(994389, 117805, 23141, '<td valign="top">Funny little dog, quite likely with bizarre habits, but not really a picture of "bizarre nature".  Shadow and blue eye glare make for distracting elements.</td>', 'Funny little dog, quite likely with bizarre habits, but not really a picture of "bizarre nature".  Shadow and blue eye glare make for distracting elements.', '2004-11-05 23:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(994392, 117906, 23141, '<td valign="top">Wonderful highlighting of this strange, twisty plant.</td>', 'Wonderful highlighting of this strange, twisty plant.', '2004-11-05 23:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(994397, 118135, 26472, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. What''s THAT supposed to be? :-) Well captured. I''m glad you kept the other rock to the left (in the photo) for perspective and contrast. The sky is a little noisy, but I''d rather it be noisy than have you smooth everything out with NeatImage. Very nice. 10</td>', 'Hmmm. What''s THAT supposed to be? :-) Well captured. I''m glad you kept the other rock to the left (in the photo) for perspective and contrast. The sky is a little noisy, but I''d rather it be noisy than have you smooth everything out with NeatImage. Very nice. 10', '2004-11-05 23:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(994409, 117676, 26472, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful. It''s amazing how strong spider webs are. I might have cropped up from the bottom a little more to eliminate the lens flare in the right corner, but it''s still a great shot. 8</td>', 'Very beautiful. It''s amazing how strong spider webs are. I might have cropped up from the bottom a little more to eliminate the lens flare in the right corner, but it''s still a great shot. 8', '2004-11-05 23:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(994419, 116184, 26472, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the highland steer in Scotland. Love the perspective you used in this shot. Nice DOF too! 8</td>', 'Reminds me of the highland steer in Scotland. Love the perspective you used in this shot. Nice DOF too! 8', '2004-11-05 23:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(994431, 118001, 23141, '<td valign="top">Pretty weird and kind of grody...  meets the challenge, but doesn''t really make for a super picture to me...</td>', 'Pretty weird and kind of grody...  meets the challenge, but doesn''t really make for a super picture to me...', '2004-11-05 23:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(994434, 117094, 23141, '<td valign="top">Adorable, but not bizarre.</td>', 'Adorable, but not bizarre.', '2004-11-05 23:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(994437, 117805, 26472, '<td valign="top">Good focus, but a red-eye reduction flash and a darker background would have greatly improved this shot for me. If you don''t have studio lights or a bounce flash, you might want to consider shooting these types of photos outside, with natural light, or further away from the wall to reduce the harsh shadows. The ears on this little guy are great. I bet that even a tight cropped shot of just the head would be interesting too. 5</td>', 'Good focus, but a red-eye reduction flash and a darker background would have greatly improved this shot for me. If you don''t have studio lights or a bounce flash, you might want to consider shooting these types of photos outside, with natural light, or further away from the wall to reduce the harsh shadows. The ears on this little guy are great. I bet that even a tight cropped shot of just the head would be interesting too. 5', '2004-11-05 23:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(994438, 118102, 23141, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but doesn''t seem to meet the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting, but doesn''t seem to meet the challenge.', '2004-11-05 23:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(994441, 117129, 26472, '<td valign="top">I''m generally not a fan of angle shots, but it works very well in this instance. 8</td>', 'I''m generally not a fan of angle shots, but it works very well in this instance. 8', '2004-11-05 23:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(994442, 118080, 23141, '<td valign="top">Pretty and colorful nature shot, but not very bizarre.  The bluriness is a distraction as well.</td>', 'Pretty and colorful nature shot, but not very bizarre.  The bluriness is a distraction as well.', '2004-11-05 23:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(994448, 116758, 23141, '<td valign="top">While not an extremely bizarre subject or a perfectly composed picture, the title made me laugh out loud.  Some people wouldn''t approve of scoring better for a title, but when it''s funny, why not?</td>', 'While not an extremely bizarre subject or a perfectly composed picture, the title made me laugh out loud.  Some people wouldn''t approve of scoring better for a title, but when it''s funny, why not?', '2004-11-05 23:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(994449, 116334, 26472, '<td valign="top">This is burlwood, isn''t it? I see a chipmunk dead center in the top row. Great shot. It really makes me stare for a long time. 9</td>', 'This is burlwood, isn''t it? I see a chipmunk dead center in the top row. Great shot. It really makes me stare for a long time. 9', '2004-11-05 23:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(994457, 116879, 23141, '<td valign="top">Good capture of very strange, weird nature.  Doesn''t hold interest for long though, and the colors seem kind of off in a blue-ish way.</td>', 'Good capture of very strange, weird nature.  Doesn''t hold interest for long though, and the colors seem kind of off in a blue-ish way.', '2004-11-05 23:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(994458, 117437, 22975, '<td valign="top">10.  I love the angle and the tongue''s position gives this image so much character.  Great submission to the challenge.</td>', '10.  I love the angle and the tongue''s position gives this image so much character.  Great submission to the challenge.', '2004-11-05 23:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(994460, 116334, 22975, '<td valign="top">What a great, knotty piece of wood!  At first, I was thinking you should have cropped out the background at the top, but now, I definitely like it there, and I think it adds som depth.  Neat shot... for meeting the challenge with a nice shot, I give you a 10.</td>', 'What a great, knotty piece of wood!  At first, I was thinking you should have cropped out the background at the top, but now, I definitely like it there, and I think it adds som depth.  Neat shot... for meeting the challenge with a nice shot, I give you a 10.', '2004-11-05 23:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(994462, 116520, 22975, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen anything like this, and the colors and shape of it are so pleasing to the eye that I can''t help but give it a 10.  This fits the challenge perfectly, and also stands alone as a nice photograph.</td>', 'I''ve never seen anything like this, and the colors and shape of it are so pleasing to the eye that I can''t help but give it a 10.  This fits the challenge perfectly, and also stands alone as a nice photograph.', '2004-11-05 23:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(994465, 117388, 22975, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!  The focus looks a little soft on the first flower, and I would have liked to have seen that one in focus first and foremost... so for that, I''m knocking off one whole point to give you a 9.  :)  The perspective and angle are great, and the complimentary colors work perfectly.</td>', 'Very interesting!  The focus looks a little soft on the first flower, and I would have liked to have seen that one in focus first and foremost... so for that, I''m knocking off one whole point to give you a 9.  :)  The perspective and angle are great, and the complimentary colors work perfectly.', '2004-11-06 00:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(994467, 117880, 26472, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. 9</td>', 'Beautifully done. 9', '2004-11-06 00:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(994468, 117969, 22975, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful tree... certainly something you don''t see everyday in nature.  :)  Bumping you to an 8.  :)</td>', 'What a beautiful tree... certainly something you don''t see everyday in nature.  :)  Bumping you to an 8.  :)', '2004-11-06 00:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(994470, 117464, 26472, '<td valign="top">Yea, that''s certainly bizarre nature. 8</td>', 'Yea, that''s certainly bizarre nature. 8', '2004-11-06 00:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(994471, 118085, 22975, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This is more like a sculpture than something in nature, which makes this shot perfect for the challenge.  I like how crisp it looks.  Good job.  9</td>', 'Wow.  This is more like a sculpture than something in nature, which makes this shot perfect for the challenge.  I like how crisp it looks.  Good job.  9', '2004-11-06 00:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(994472, 116578, 26472, '<td valign="top">Cool. I''m not generally a fan of such intense colors, but it works very well in this shot. 8</td>', 'Cool. I''m not generally a fan of such intense colors, but it works very well in this shot. 8', '2004-11-06 00:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(994595, 116489, 24674, '<td valign="top">great photo but off-topic ...6</td>', 'great photo but off-topic ...6', '2004-11-06 01:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(994598, 117885, 26401, '<td valign="top">Certainly an unusual shot. Nice eye! Good caption.</td>', 'Certainly an unusual shot. Nice eye! Good caption.', '2004-11-06 01:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(994600, 117100, 26401, '<td valign="top">Unusual. Nicely framed.</td>', 'Unusual. Nicely framed.', '2004-11-06 01:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(994601, 117679, 26401, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen a flower like this. Very unusual colours in the foliage.</td>', 'I''ve never seen a flower like this. Very unusual colours in the foliage.', '2004-11-06 01:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
