(995618, 117121, 18197, '<td valign="top">Cool. I grew up in a part of the country where Yuccas grow wild. As a boy, we would wade through fields of them while hunting or out hiking. We hated them because they were stickery and because they sometimes hid rattlesnakes. You photo is enough to give the lowly Yucca a good name! Great capture. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Cool. I grew up in a part of the country where Yuccas grow wild. As a boy, we would wade through fields of them while hunting or out hiking. We hated them because they were stickery and because they sometimes hid rattlesnakes. You photo is enough to give the lowly Yucca a good name! Great capture. Among my top picks.', '2004-11-06 16:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(995622, 116076, 5746, '<td valign="top">Actually you cropped most of the amazing colours :( But ihe tree looks magnificent. Just the cropping. 7.</td>', 'Actually you cropped most of the amazing colours :( But ihe tree looks magnificent. Just the cropping. 7.', '2004-11-06 16:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(995623, 117662, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. The colors are a bit too vibrant for my taste but they work well with the subject. There''s something odd going on with DOF. Focus on the mushrooms themselves is a bit soft. Sounds like I don''t like the photo, but that''s not true. It''s one of my top 3 picks this challenge. It''s a beautiful photo in spite of these pretty minor distractions.</td>', 'Very nice capture. The colors are a bit too vibrant for my taste but they work well with the subject. There''s something odd going on with DOF. Focus on the mushrooms themselves is a bit soft. Sounds like I don''t like the photo, but that''s not true. It''s one of my top 3 picks this challenge. It''s a beautiful photo in spite of these pretty minor distractions.', '2004-11-06 16:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(995625, 118057, 5746, '<td valign="top">I wish there was more context, so we could see easily this are rocks. At first I thought it is another tree. The subject is amazing, but without the title is hard too guess 7.</td>', 'I wish there was more context, so we could see easily this are rocks. At first I thought it is another tree. The subject is amazing, but without the title is hard too guess 7.', '2004-11-06 16:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
