(996479, 117129, 27767, '<td valign="top">Took me a little to see a head looking off the the right, but I now like this shot a lot.  Great job seeing this interpretation.</td>', 'Took me a little to see a head looking off the the right, but I now like this shot a lot.  Great job seeing this interpretation.', '2004-11-07 07:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
