(997038, 116512, 16957, '<td valign="top">Elegant, striking and artful. I particularly like the abstract quality of this shot, which on closer inspection reveals itself as simply a plant. I''ve never been a great fan orf borders but this one definitely helps. This is a phot about the wondrous colour and pattern in nature. Well done. 9</td>', 'Elegant, striking and artful. I particularly like the abstract quality of this shot, which on closer inspection reveals itself as simply a plant. I''ve never been a great fan orf borders but this one definitely helps. This is a phot about the wondrous colour and pattern in nature. Well done. 9', '2004-11-07 15:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(997046, 118141, 16957, '<td valign="top">This is a striking subject but as an image of a natural phenomenon, it is weakened by the artificial setting and the harsh lighting. Such a subject would be difficult, admittedly, to capture in nature but look closely at many ordinary things (trees, leaves, streams etc.), in varying lighting conditions and from all angles and you will find a subject that fits this challenge and conveys the idea of the humorous, bizarre or wondrous far more effectively that any staged shot.</td>', 'This is a striking subject but as an image of a natural phenomenon, it is weakened by the artificial setting and the harsh lighting. Such a subject would be difficult, admittedly, to capture in nature but look closely at many ordinary things (trees, leaves, streams etc.), in varying lighting conditions and from all angles and you will find a subject that fits this challenge and conveys the idea of the humorous, bizarre or wondrous far more effectively that any staged shot.', '2004-11-07 15:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
