(998391, 116880, 23301, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but doesn''t quite do it; There still imbalance in the picture, too much dark in the bottom. Weird negative space effect with black color. And I think there''s too much of clouds(?). Cropping more black hill and less clouds would bring the space play more into surface. And I fail to see the bizardiness in this.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Nice idea, but doesn''t quite do it; There still imbalance in the picture, too much dark in the bottom. Weird negative space effect with black color. And I think there''s too much of clouds(?). Cropping more black hill and less clouds would bring the space play more into surface. And I fail to see the bizardiness in this. ', '2004-11-08 04:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(998441, 117813, 27482, '<td valign="top">Off topic IMO, this isn´t natural but something man made.  The shot itself is allright though except for the blown out sky, would probably have done well in another challenge.</td>', 'Off topic IMO, this isn´t natural but something man made.  The shot itself is allright though except for the blown out sky, would probably have done well in another challenge.', '2004-11-08 06:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(998478, 118173, 27482, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, but I don´t think the title goes with the image, simply because the stones give it away as not being taken in flight.  I gave it an 8.</td>', 'Awesome shot, but I don´t think the title goes with the image, simply because the stones give it away as not being taken in flight.  I gave it an 8.', '2004-11-08 06:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(998482, 118045, 27482, '<td valign="top">No no no....  I just don´t get why you would ruin this photo like that, with that cheezy invert light effect.  I am sorry but I can´t rate it very high, it probably would have been a killer shot if you would have left the tree and bushes a black silhouette.  Good composition though.</td>', 'No no no....  I just don´t get why you would ruin this photo like that, with that cheezy invert light effect.  I am sorry but I can´t rate it very high, it probably would have been a killer shot if you would have left the tree and bushes a black silhouette.  Good composition though.', '2004-11-08 06:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(998484, 118102, 27482, '<td valign="top">Somehow I think this would do well in an art gallery but I doubt you will be anywhere but in the bottom 20% with this one.</td>', 'Somehow I think this would do well in an art gallery but I doubt you will be anywhere but in the bottom 20% with this one.', '2004-11-08 07:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(998492, 117464, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cool shell, what kind of animal is that?  Anyway the strong backlight isn´t helping this shot and the bottom left corner is a bit empty and doesn´t really serve a purpouse but I like this shot, better than average in this competition.</td>', 'Cool shell, what kind of animal is that?  Anyway the strong backlight isn´t helping this shot and the bottom left corner is a bit empty and doesn´t really serve a purpouse but I like this shot, better than average in this competition.', '2004-11-08 07:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
