(998839, 118150, 21714, '<td valign="top">Yep. It IS amazing. Totally unbelievable colours. That''s some wild cloud formation. I really like the way you have used the whole scene to create the total impact of the image. Excellent work.</td>', 'Yep. It IS amazing. Totally unbelievable colours. That''s some wild cloud formation. I really like the way you have used the whole scene to create the total impact of the image. Excellent work.', '2004-11-08 11:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
