(998843, 116334, 21714, '<td valign="top">Now that''s spoooooky! I see faces popping out of everywhere. I can even see the ears, lips and hair! Cool stuff. Well done.</td>', 'Now that''s spoooooky! I see faces popping out of everywhere. I can even see the ears, lips and hair! Cool stuff. Well done.', '2004-11-08 11:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(998848, 116658, 21714, '<td valign="top">I can''t talk about the Bizarre factor of this one, but this has to be one of the most beautiful nature shots on DPC.  Absolutely breathtaking.</td>', 'I can''t talk about the Bizarre factor of this one, but this has to be one of the most beautiful nature shots on DPC.  Absolutely breathtaking.', '2004-11-08 11:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(998854, 116917, 21714, '<td valign="top">That''s one weird looking flower. Like the way you have shot with red and yellow on either side. Looks a bit like it lacks sharpness and depth. Hard to tell what it is, but I get the feeling that it''s blurred or smudged.  Good work though.</td>', 'That''s one weird looking flower. Like the way you have shot with red and yellow on either side. Looks a bit like it lacks sharpness and depth. Hard to tell what it is, but I get the feeling that it''s blurred or smudged.  Good work though.', '2004-11-08 11:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
