(999490, 116328, 12809, '<td valign="top">I think a simple shot of the lunar eclipse would score better.  Still a good try.</td>', 'I think a simple shot of the lunar eclipse would score better.  Still a good try.', '2004-11-08 17:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(999493, 116725, 12809, '<td valign="top">Focus is mainly on the one bug.  I would prefer sharp focus on all of the bugs.</td>', 'Focus is mainly on the one bug.  I would prefer sharp focus on all of the bugs.', '2004-11-08 17:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(999495, 117813, 12809, '<td valign="top">Cool shot and nice landscaping.  The sky is blown out but the fg has good exposure.  I don''t really consider this "natural"...I would consider this manmade.  Awesome clock, though.</td>', 'Cool shot and nice landscaping.  The sky is blown out but the fg has good exposure.  I don''t really consider this "natural"...I would consider this manmade.  Awesome clock, though.', '2004-11-08 17:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(999503, 117676, 12809, '<td valign="top">I haven''t gotten far with the voting, but it''s good to see someone has finally used some creativty along with meeting the challenge - it''s natural and it makes one wonder in amazement how these webs are formed and the water manages to hang on.  I like the bit of sparkle you caught in the beads on the left.</td>', 'I haven''t gotten far with the voting, but it''s good to see someone has finally used some creativty along with meeting the challenge - it''s natural and it makes one wonder in amazement how these webs are formed and the water manages to hang on.  I like the bit of sparkle you caught in the beads on the left.', '2004-11-08 17:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(999508, 118103, 12809, '<td valign="top">Okay, you win.  You made me laugh. :-)  I love the colors/tones you achieved.</td>', 'Okay, you win.  You made me laugh. :-)  I love the colors/tones you achieved.', '2004-11-08 17:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(999511, 116701, 12809, '<td valign="top">Cool looking tree.  Lighting seems a bit harsh on the left and the right is quite dark.  Some nice soft light near sunrise/set would have brought out the texture in this as well as provided some good tones.</td>', 'Cool looking tree.  Lighting seems a bit harsh on the left and the right is quite dark.  Some nice soft light near sunrise/set would have brought out the texture in this as well as provided some good tones.', '2004-11-08 17:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(999514, 116185, 12809, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Good imagination. I wish we could see more detail in the black ''goose''.  Looks like the sharpening is a bit heavy; a little goes a long way.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Cute.  Good imagination. I wish we could see more detail in the black ''goose''.  Looks like the sharpening is a bit heavy; a little goes a long way.  Nice shot.', '2004-11-08 17:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(999518, 117679, 12809, '<td valign="top">Pretty flower.  The whacked out colors don''t help this feel "natural" and the image isn''t making me wonder in amazement and is not causing me to laugh...</td>', 'Pretty flower.  The whacked out colors don''t help this feel "natural" and the image isn''t making me wonder in amazement and is not causing me to laugh...', '2004-11-08 17:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(999521, 118162, 12809, '<td valign="top">Yay, another that follows the theme!  Nice colors, tones, and texture.  I''m wondering if this may even look better with the shrubs cropped out...what do you think?  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Yay, another that follows the theme!  Nice colors, tones, and texture.  I''m wondering if this may even look better with the shrubs cropped out...what do you think?  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-11-08 17:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(999524, 118110, 12809, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Good sharpness.  Might have liked to see both antennae/eyes (?) in focus.  I like the dof on the bg though.  Good work.</td>', 'Great shot.  Good sharpness.  Might have liked to see both antennae/eyes (?) in focus.  I like the dof on the bg though.  Good work.', '2004-11-08 17:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(999526, 118039, 12809, '<td valign="top">Cool, unique, and ''bizarre''.  Good luck.</td>', 'Cool, unique, and ''bizarre''.  Good luck.', '2004-11-08 17:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(999529, 117922, 12809, '<td valign="top">This may also look good in b&amp;w.</td>', 'This may also look good in b&w.', '2004-11-08 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(999533, 117100, 12809, '<td valign="top">Good eye.  It does look like a whale.</td>', 'Good eye.  It does look like a whale.', '2004-11-08 17:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(999536, 118051, 12809, '<td valign="top">Interesting bug.  Maybe a tighter crop would help avoid the distraction of the blown out bg...?</td>', 'Interesting bug.  Maybe a tighter crop would help avoid the distraction of the blown out bg...?', '2004-11-08 17:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(999543, 117022, 12809, '<td valign="top">Strange.  Good find.</td>', 'Strange.  Good find.', '2004-11-08 17:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(999545, 118126, 12809, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Funny with the title.  I like the comp and crop.</td>', 'Heh!  Funny with the title.  I like the comp and crop.', '2004-11-08 17:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(999553, 118150, 12809, '<td valign="top">It is amazing.  Gorgeous colors - are they natural or did you saturate them?  Looks cool either way.  Love the shapes of the clouds.  I haven''t gotten that far in the voting but you are my first 9.  Don''t thing I''ve even given an 8 yet!  Congrats.  Best of luck to you. :-)</td>', 'It is amazing.  Gorgeous colors - are they natural or did you saturate them?  Looks cool either way.  Love the shapes of the clouds.  I haven''t gotten that far in the voting but you are my first 9.  Don''t thing I''ve even given an 8 yet!  Congrats.  Best of luck to you. :-)', '2004-11-08 17:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(999555, 117839, 12809, '<td valign="top">Weird.  What is it?</td>', 'Weird.  What is it?', '2004-11-08 17:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(999560, 117381, 12809, '<td valign="top">Live in NY? :-)  Was 64 yesterday and I woke up to snow here this morning.  Cute little pine tree.  I love fluffy, white snow.</td>', 'Live in NY? :-)  Was 64 yesterday and I woke up to snow here this morning.  Cute little pine tree.  I love fluffy, white snow.', '2004-11-08 18:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(999564, 118042, 12809, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.  Wish the rest of his trunk were in the shot.</td>', 'Cute shot.  Wish the rest of his trunk were in the shot.', '2004-11-08 18:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(999568, 118140, 12809, '<td valign="top">That''s really strange!  (Yay, yet another that meets the challenge.)  Interesting find.</td>', 'That''s really strange!  (Yay, yet another that meets the challenge.)  Interesting find.', '2004-11-08 18:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(999571, 116932, 12809, '<td valign="top">LOL!  You probably could have grabbed his tail and given him quite a surprise! :-)  Funny shot.</td>', 'LOL!  You probably could have grabbed his tail and given him quite a surprise! :-)  Funny shot.', '2004-11-08 18:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(999577, 116578, 12809, '<td valign="top">One of the best I''ve seen so far.  Giving you and 8.  Almost gave you a 9 but the "teeth" are quite blown out.  Love the green against the red bg.  Great idea with the bat.  Good luck!</td>', 'One of the best I''ve seen so far.  Giving you and 8.  Almost gave you a 9 but the "teeth" are quite blown out.  Love the green against the red bg.  Great idea with the bat.  Good luck!', '2004-11-08 18:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(999582, 117982, 12809, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  That''s wild.  All flamingos?  Really cool.  I''ve never seen such a thing.  Giving you an 8.  Good luck!</td>', 'Whoa!  That''s wild.  All flamingos?  Really cool.  I''ve never seen such a thing.  Giving you an 8.  Good luck!', '2004-11-08 18:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(999583, 118080, 12809, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot.  One of the best in the bunch so far.  Giving you an 8.  Good luck!</td>', 'Terrific shot.  One of the best in the bunch so far.  Giving you an 8.  Good luck!', '2004-11-08 18:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(999587, 118054, 12809, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot but extremely oversharpened...</td>', 'Interesting shot but extremely oversharpened...', '2004-11-08 18:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(999589, 118100, 12809, '<td valign="top">Weird!  Wonder why/how they grew like that.</td>', 'Weird!  Wonder why/how they grew like that.', '2004-11-08 18:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(999594, 116057, 12809, '<td valign="top">Looks oversaturated with red (leaves in fg are red)  to get the "fire" effect in the sky...</td>', 'Looks oversaturated with red (leaves in fg are red)  to get the "fire" effect in the sky...', '2004-11-08 18:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(999605, 116044, 12809, '<td valign="top">I tried to get this shot the night after the eclipse but didn''t succeed.  Your moon is overexposed but it was worth it to get the nice halo.  I think a little crop off the left would work.  I think this image would still work being centered.  Good job.</td>', 'I tried to get this shot the night after the eclipse but didn''t succeed.  Your moon is overexposed but it was worth it to get the nice halo.  I think a little crop off the left would work.  I think this image would still work being centered.  Good job.', '2004-11-08 18:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(999609, 117941, 12809, '<td valign="top">lol, I see it.  Funny.</td>', 'lol, I see it.  Funny.', '2004-11-08 18:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(999611, 117114, 12809, '<td valign="top">Hmm, what is it?  Is it nature?  I can''t figure it out...</td>', 'Hmm, what is it?  Is it nature?  I can''t figure it out...', '2004-11-08 18:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(999614, 116418, 12809, '<td valign="top">The similarity of the sky and ground is strange.  At first glance the foam appears to be snow.</td>', 'The similarity of the sky and ground is strange.  At first glance the foam appears to be snow.', '2004-11-08 18:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(999616, 116917, 12809, '<td valign="top">Strange flower.  Would have liked to have seen this more in focus.</td>', 'Strange flower.  Would have liked to have seen this more in focus.', '2004-11-08 18:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(999618, 116491, 12809, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenes and good eye to see the reflection.  I''m not crazy about the purple sky though...</td>', 'Beautiful scenes and good eye to see the reflection.  I''m not crazy about the purple sky though...', '2004-11-08 18:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(999619, 118142, 27416, '<td valign="top">Wow what a shot this is one of my favorites<br/></td>', 'Wow what a shot this is one of my favorites', '2004-11-08 18:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(999623, 117186, 12809, '<td valign="top">lol, funny expression on the goose.  Weird ''do'' on the duck. lol</td>', 'lol, funny expression on the goose.  Weird ''do'' on the duck. lol', '2004-11-08 18:26:49.000000', NULL, 1);
