(1000879, 118057, 24511, '<td valign="top">I love rocks but I find lighting too challenging for me.  Your shot demonstrates nice wavy lines but minimal color and shaded areas leave me with less of a spectacular rock formation response.  If you hear of good tips for cavern rock photo taking please let me know.  Your photo rocks.  6</td>', 'I love rocks but I find lighting too challenging for me.  Your shot demonstrates nice wavy lines but minimal color and shaded areas leave me with less of a spectacular rock formation response.  If you hear of good tips for cavern rock photo taking please let me know.  Your photo rocks.  6', '2004-11-09 11:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
