(1000908, 116880, 24511, '<td valign="top">Pixel deprived, this photo reminds me of a famous painting "Scream".  The hill barely visible leave much to the imagination and all those campfire tales of chopped body parts and mysterious sounds of branches brushing in the wind.  I often yearn for colorful and in focus entries but yours made me shiver with a big 8 score.  Thanks.</td>', 'Pixel deprived, this photo reminds me of a famous painting "Scream".  The hill barely visible leave much to the imagination and all those campfire tales of chopped body parts and mysterious sounds of branches brushing in the wind.  I often yearn for colorful and in focus entries but yours made me shiver with a big 8 score.  Thanks.', '2004-11-09 12:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000919, 117040, 24511, '<td valign="top">Browns on the squirl bizare.  Leaf and blades of grass a great addition for balance and color in the foreground.  The brown branches in the background support the focal point.  Very cute image.  Almost scored a 10.  Thanks for now.  9</td>', 'Browns on the squirl bizare.  Leaf and blades of grass a great addition for balance and color in the foreground.  The brown branches in the background support the focal point.  Very cute image.  Almost scored a 10.  Thanks for now.  9', '2004-11-09 12:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
