(1001001, 118123, 24511, '<td valign="top">Loved the photo but hated the title.  Looks like a split sand dollar to me.  Bright,  in focus and interesting shadow contrasts.  Framing my favorite part of photo.  Thanks.</td>', 'Loved the photo but hated the title.  Looks like a split sand dollar to me.  Bright,  in focus and interesting shadow contrasts.  Framing my favorite part of photo.  Thanks.', '2004-11-09 12:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
