(1001019, 116504, 24511, '<td valign="top">LOL weird stuff going on here.  Great soccer fans watching the game from the sidelines.  One of my many favorites this challenge.  Thanks.  9</td>', 'LOL weird stuff going on here.  Great soccer fans watching the game from the sidelines.  One of my many favorites this challenge.  Thanks.  9', '2004-11-09 13:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1001021, 117967, 24511, '<td valign="top">Ha! 9</td>', 'Ha! 9', '2004-11-09 13:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1001029, 118107, 24511, '<td valign="top">I''m not a cat enthousiast but your photo is lively and full of wonder.  You don''t get my weird votes but you do get all my wow votes.  10 thanks.  ...and my favorite collection thanks you.</td>', 'I''m not a cat enthousiast but your photo is lively and full of wonder.  You don''t get my weird votes but you do get all my wow votes.  10 thanks.  ...and my favorite collection thanks you.', '2004-11-09 13:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1001033, 116595, 27915, '<td valign="top">Good example of the species Dildus variatus.  Apparently there are a lot of Mother Natures. They aren''t jealouse, there is no waiting. What the heck is that anyway? somesorta mangrove? I give it a ten,  tho it looks like it is over that several times.</td>', 'Good example of the species Dildus variatus.  Apparently there are a lot of Mother Natures. They aren''t jealouse, there is no waiting. What the heck is that anyway? somesorta mangrove? I give it a ten,  tho it looks like it is over that several times.', '2004-11-09 13:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1001035, 116872, 24511, '<td valign="top">color, angle, clarity...wow and wow.  No weird votes but my second 10 for wowness.  Thanks.  The blues and exquisite.</td>', 'color, angle, clarity...wow and wow.  No weird votes but my second 10 for wowness.  Thanks.  The blues and exquisite.', '2004-11-09 13:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1001057, 118202, 15832, '<td valign="top">Cool... I really like this one. Personally i think it would even be better without those two ber trees in the front.<br/></td>', 'Cool... I really like this one. Personally i think it would even be better without those two ber trees in the front.', '2004-11-09 13:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1001066, 116658, 25143, '<td valign="top">updating my comment : this is truly a beautiful scene</td>', 'updating my comment : this is truly a beautiful scene', '2004-11-09 13:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1001096, 117359, 25347, '<td valign="top">Kia ora!<br/> <br/>This is an excellent shot, I love it.  I got marvelous opportunity to see one of these little guys at night in the wild when I visited the South Island.  This is an excellent shot, well composed.  None of the factors that would improve it were under your control (the bit of green stuff by his feet), however the shot seems to have sort of a bluish tint on his head and back, maybe I''m just crazy.  Either way, excellent capture, probably the best picture in the challenge.</td>', 'Kia ora! This is an excellent shot, I love it.  I got marvelous opportunity to see one of these little guys at night in the wild when I visited the South Island.  This is an excellent shot, well composed.  None of the factors that would improve it were under your control (the bit of green stuff by his feet), however the shot seems to have sort of a bluish tint on his head and back, maybe I''m just crazy.  Either way, excellent capture, probably the best picture in the challenge.', '2004-11-09 13:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1001097, 117973, 27293, '<td valign="top">i just hate the crop, the composition and the red border.</td>', 'i just hate the crop, the composition and the red border.', '2004-11-09 13:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
