(1001125, 116963, 27293, '<td valign="top">I may not be getting it, but this doesn''t look natural. This is a nice shot, with the exception of blown and covered up hilights, but i just think it''s something man-made, whatever it is. An alien mask?</td>', 'I may not be getting it, but this doesn''t look natural. This is a nice shot, with the exception of blown and covered up hilights, but i just think it''s something man-made, whatever it is. An alien mask?', '2004-11-09 14:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
