(1001128, 117072, 27293, '<td valign="top">I don''t much like the shot visually or technically, but this is the best challenge topic rendition among all the entries, so a 10.</td>', 'I don''t much like the shot visually or technically, but this is the best challenge topic rendition among all the entries, so a 10.', '2004-11-09 14:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
