(1001157, 117094, 28820, '<td valign="top">The framing is nice, but it''s too bad the highlights are overexposed, it distracts from the main focal point of the photograph.  It''d rate this higher if it this were submitted in another category other than "Bizarre Nature".</td>', 'The framing is nice, but it''s too bad the highlights are overexposed, it distracts from the main focal point of the photograph.  It''d rate this higher if it this were submitted in another category other than "Bizarre Nature".', '2004-11-09 14:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
