(1001219, 118110, 21714, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition.  It makes a beautiful image. However, I do think that DOF is falling a wee bit short here.  Maybe it''s the actual focus point. But the way it''s now, the sharpest area of the image doesn''t look like that''s what I should be looking at. <br/>Overall, I think it''s a very good image. All the best.</td>', 'I really like the composition.  It makes a beautiful image. However, I do think that DOF is falling a wee bit short here.  Maybe it''s the actual focus point. But the way it''s now, the sharpest area of the image doesn''t look like that''s what I should be looking at. Overall, I think it''s a very good image. All the best.', '2004-11-09 14:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1001222, 117679, 28820, '<td valign="top">Nice coloring, but the focusing is too soft on the flower.</td>', 'Nice coloring, but the focusing is too soft on the flower.', '2004-11-09 14:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1001227, 118101, 28820, '<td valign="top">I don''t really find this bizarre.</td>', 'I don''t really find this bizarre.', '2004-11-09 14:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1001233, 116520, 21714, '<td valign="top">I like this image but I think that there''s too much in it. I love the colours and detail and the shapes. But because of everything else going around the little plant, you begin to wonder. Your eyes start rolling :) <br/>I think a  tighter crop would work better on this. The bit at the top and right are bit distracting. As the title suggests, what you really want to show is this little plant being eaten. That part of the image is very interesting, but the rest of stuff around it spoils the impact.</td>', 'I like this image but I think that there''s too much in it. I love the colours and detail and the shapes. But because of everything else going around the little plant, you begin to wonder. Your eyes start rolling :) I think a  tighter crop would work better on this. The bit at the top and right are bit distracting. As the title suggests, what you really want to show is this little plant being eaten. That part of the image is very interesting, but the rest of stuff around it spoils the impact.', '2004-11-09 15:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1001235, 117298, 28820, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the main subject is too out of focus.  I''d rather see the Sea Monkeys than the bulb.</td>', 'Good idea, but the main subject is too out of focus.  I''d rather see the Sea Monkeys than the bulb.', '2004-11-09 15:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1001236, 117979, 21714, '<td valign="top">Hope you are not implying it''s a middle finger :) Well, that''s what I see in this image. There this flower telling me to f**** off! :) <br/>I like it.</td>', 'Hope you are not implying it''s a middle finger :) Well, that''s what I see in this image. There this flower telling me to f**** off! :) I like it.', '2004-11-09 15:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
