(1001240, 116334, 28820, '<td valign="top">Nice work.  A bit over-exposed though.</td>', 'Nice work.  A bit over-exposed though.', '2004-11-09 15:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1001245, 115990, 21714, '<td valign="top">I wonder if that''s really the colour of their eyes during maring or if that''s the flash. It''s a very interesting image. In fact I have never seen squrrels at it before :) <br/>But ... :) I actually don''t find it bizarre. <br/>Well done for the capture though.</td>', 'I wonder if that''s really the colour of their eyes during maring or if that''s the flash. It''s a very interesting image. In fact I have never seen squrrels at it before :) But ... :) I actually don''t find it bizarre. Well done for the capture though.', '2004-11-09 15:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
