(1001258, 117468, 21714, '<td valign="top">Great great capture. I love this image. Focus, timing and control of DOF is great. Nice crop too.  But, I actually don''t find it bizarre. Isn''t the bird just eating? That''s what I see anyway. Hope I am not wrong about that. <br/>Great job with the shot.</td>', 'Great great capture. I love this image. Focus, timing and control of DOF is great. Nice crop too.  But, I actually don''t find it bizarre. Isn''t the bird just eating? That''s what I see anyway. Hope I am not wrong about that. Great job with the shot.', '2004-11-09 15:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
