(1002004, 117501, 25831, '<td valign="top">i like the concept.. i wish the blinds weren''t there. it makes it seem as if the photograph were rushed and it looks sloppy. But it is amazing to see such a bright leaf among such a melancholic surrounding</td>', 'i like the concept.. i wish the blinds weren''t there. it makes it seem as if the photograph were rushed and it looks sloppy. But it is amazing to see such a bright leaf among such a melancholic surrounding', '2004-11-09 21:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
