(1002027, 118040, 26799, '<td valign="top">I am sure you will get this a few times, but your picture is a little small. There is a great tutorial under "Learn" that will show you how to resize your image for the DP Challenges.</td>', 'I am sure you will get this a few times, but your picture is a little small. There is a great tutorial under "Learn" that will show you how to resize your image for the DP Challenges.', '2004-11-09 22:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
