(1002154, 116923, 15811, '<td valign="top">Your focus seems a little off here and the image is too small.  If the squirrel was on the other side of the tree, getting more light, I''m sure it would have turned out a lot better.  Also, not sure what that is in the upper right corner, but it''s distracting as is that nipple-looking thing protruding from the right side of the tree. :-D</td>', 'Your focus seems a little off here and the image is too small.  If the squirrel was on the other side of the tree, getting more light, I''m sure it would have turned out a lot better.  Also, not sure what that is in the upper right corner, but it''s distracting as is that nipple-looking thing protruding from the right side of the tree. :-D', '2004-11-09 23:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002157, 116852, 15811, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, great color.  I was just out the other week trying to get a shot like this, but failed miserably (due to lighting mostly).  Nice work!</td>', 'Beautiful shot, great color.  I was just out the other week trying to get a shot like this, but failed miserably (due to lighting mostly).  Nice work!', '2004-11-09 23:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002162, 117476, 15811, '<td valign="top">The image just seems a little ''bland'' to me.  Maybe there''s not enough color here represented by the photo -- I know it had to be there, seems like the camera just didn''t capture it, possibly because of the lighting?</td>', 'The image just seems a little ''bland'' to me.  Maybe there''s not enough color here represented by the photo -- I know it had to be there, seems like the camera just didn''t capture it, possibly because of the lighting?', '2004-11-09 23:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002167, 117471, 15811, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot -- great subject choice.   Stronger lighting could have helped the image greatly, however.</td>', 'Very interesting shot -- great subject choice.   Stronger lighting could have helped the image greatly, however.', '2004-11-09 23:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002171, 117382, 15811, '<td valign="top">Great subject, great focus and lighting.  I liek this entry a lot.</td>', 'Great subject, great focus and lighting.  I liek this entry a lot.', '2004-11-09 23:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
