(1002439, 116932, 9389, '<td valign="top">This photo was one in a series I took over several days.  In fact, my pumpkin and this squirrel''s desire to make it his own, has been documented in my blog <a href="//www.geofffox.com/MT/archives/cat_the_squirrel_chronicles.php" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.geofffox.com/MT/archives/cat_the_squirrel_chronicles.php</a>.  <br/> <br/>This particular photo, not the sharpest I took (as was noted by some astute commenters), was actually shot through the window alongside my front door.  The day was gloomy and rainy.  I wish there had been more light.<br/> <br/>Thanks to all for looking and commenting.  Taking photos to satisfy a challenge has become a fun obsession.</td>', 'This photo was one in a series I took over several days.  In fact, my pumpkin and this squirrel''s desire to make it his own, has been documented in my blog //www.geofffox.com/MT/archives/cat_the_squirrel_chronicles.php.   This particular photo, not the sharpest I took (as was noted by some astute commenters), was actually shot through the window alongside my front door.  The day was gloomy and rainy.  I wish there had been more light. Thanks to all for looking and commenting.  Taking photos to satisfy a challenge has become a fun obsession.', '2004-11-10 00:39:24.000000', NULL, 0),
