(1002555, 116334, 24778, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for you voting... it''s my personal best since now, I wished so much to finish top 10... the next target is a ribon :)... <br/> <br/>but still this 7th place came as a gift, because today is my birthday. hope not to get a ribbon on the next aniversary... hehehe<br/> <br/>thanks again<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-10 05:39:33.</i></td>', 'Thank you all for you voting... it''s my personal best since now, I wished so much to finish top 10... the next target is a ribon :)...  but still this 7th place came as a gift, because today is my birthday. hope not to get a ribbon on the next aniversary... hehehe thanks again', '2004-11-10 01:23:32.000000', '2004-11-10 05:39:33.000000', 0),
