(1002767, 117967, 27440, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all of you for voting on me!<br/> <br/>I achieved my goal -  judging  by your comments - This was supposed to make people laugh and ... it did :)<br/> <br/>There where many amazing shots in this chalange, congrats to all photographers and good luck to you all :)<br/> <br/>That''s my doggie here, she''s adorable. I shot this the last day ( as I remember ). This shot wasn''t intended to be high key but since I had nothing to use as my background I used my white wallpaper. Then I seeked a way to remove it without breaking the rules and afterall I am very happy with this big contrast and the high key.<br/> <br/>The nose was ment to be blurred from the very beginnig.<br/> <br/>When I saw the challange I first wanted to shot a horse. This particular horse is named Szanta and she does pretty amazing things :) Well didn''t have time for that one. Then I wanted to use her for the macro challange, but well... didn''t have time for that one either.  <br/> <br/>As I sad, congrats to you all :)</td>', 'Thanks to all of you for voting on me! I achieved my goal -  judging  by your comments - This was supposed to make people laugh and ... it did :) There where many amazing shots in this chalange, congrats to all photographers and good luck to you all :) That''s my doggie here, she''s adorable. I shot this the last day ( as I remember ). This shot wasn''t intended to be high key but since I had nothing to use as my background I used my white wallpaper. Then I seeked a way to remove it without breaking the rules and afterall I am very happy with this big contrast and the high key. The nose was ment to be blurred from the very beginnig. When I saw the challange I first wanted to shot a horse. This particular horse is named Szanta and she does pretty amazing things :) Well didn''t have time for that one. Then I wanted to use her for the macro challange, but well... didn''t have time for that one either.   As I sad, congrats to you all :)', '2004-11-10 02:57:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1002776, 118107, 27440, '<td valign="top">So graphicfunk we end up so near eachother afterall :) <br/> <br/>Good luck to you :) And I hope seeing your work in the macro challange :)</td>', 'So graphicfunk we end up so near eachother afterall :)  Good luck to you :) And I hope seeing your work in the macro challange :)', '2004-11-10 03:02:46.000000', NULL, 0),
