(1002850, 117982, 16957, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments. I must say I didn''t expect this photo to do all that well as I think the colours are quite washed out. The composition pleased me though. As my first entry since July I am happy! The birds are flamingos in Lake Nakuru in Kenya. I was there attending a workshop on land problems and grabbed a couple of hours to visit the National Park. All is not well though and the environment is under threat. Read a recent press story <a href="//www.guardian.co.uk/kenya/story/0,,1344163,00.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here</a>.</td>', 'Thanks for all your comments. I must say I didn''t expect this photo to do all that well as I think the colours are quite washed out. The composition pleased me though. As my first entry since July I am happy! The birds are flamingos in Lake Nakuru in Kenya. I was there attending a workshop on land problems and grabbed a couple of hours to visit the National Park. All is not well though and the environment is under threat. Read a recent press story here.', '2004-11-10 04:16:48.000000', NULL, 0),
