(1002898, 116512, 19035, '<td valign="top">Anyone have any clue what this plant is?  One person told me its Sumac, but I''m not sure.  I was very fortunate to see these colors, it was a truley amazing find.  Thanks to everyone for all your great comments and generous scores.  It was very exciting to rank this high.  Amost made riboon!   Wahoo!</td>', 'Anyone have any clue what this plant is?  One person told me its Sumac, but I''m not sure.  I was very fortunate to see these colors, it was a truley amazing find.  Thanks to everyone for all your great comments and generous scores.  It was very exciting to rank this high.  Amost made riboon!   Wahoo!', '2004-11-10 05:52:04.000000', NULL, 0),
