(1003677, 117982, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is a great image.  You also stand out since it''s an excellent example of a cpativating photo using pastel colors, rather than bold colors.</td>', 'This is a great image.  You also stand out since it''s an excellent example of a cpativating photo using pastel colors, rather than bold colors.', '2004-11-10 12:19:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1003689, 116086, 25742, '<td valign="top">til hamingju<br/>Þetta er reyndar ekki jökulvatn í Hraunfossunum sjálfum, en Hvítár er auðvitað jökulá.<br/>Góð hugmynd.</td>', 'til hamingjuÞetta er reyndar ekki jökulvatn í Hraunfossunum sjálfum, en Hvítár er auðvitað jökulá.Góð hugmynd.', '2004-11-10 12:24:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1003692, 116578, 27845, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments. This was my very first submission and I''m proud of my place. Although I must admit I hoped for a Top 50...<br/>Your comments are very helpful to me. I know now what to worry about when I''m going to take my next shots.<br/>I knew about those white teeth but I could not change it. The light had to be very close because otherwise the silhouette of the bat (actually a Halloween confetti) would not have come out as well.<br/>About the colors: Many said they didn''t like them. I first tried a blue background, but in the end I decided for the biggest possible contrast. The colours were not ment to be soothing, but to cry out loud. (''Murder, murder'' ;)</td>', 'Thanks for all your comments. This was my very first submission and I''m proud of my place. Although I must admit I hoped for a Top 50...Your comments are very helpful to me. I know now what to worry about when I''m going to take my next shots.I knew about those white teeth but I could not change it. The light had to be very close because otherwise the silhouette of the bat (actually a Halloween confetti) would not have come out as well.About the colors: Many said they didn''t like them. I first tried a blue background, but in the end I decided for the biggest possible contrast. The colours were not ment to be soothing, but to cry out loud. (''Murder, murder'' ;)', '2004-11-10 12:26:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1004100, 116086, 15832, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the Comments...<br/>The water that´s puring down there is rain water that the lava  field collects, but the river itself is a glacier-river.<br/>I decided to call it "glacier water puring out of nowhere" so people wouldn´t doubt the colour of the river :)<br/> <br/>Thanks again..</td>', 'Thanks for all the Comments...The water that´s puring down there is rain water that the lava  field collects, but the river itself is a glacier-river.I decided to call it "glacier water puring out of nowhere" so people wouldn´t doubt the colour of the river :) Thanks again..', '2004-11-10 14:22:50.000000', NULL, 0),
