(1004866, 117186, 5746, '<td valign="top">I came back to check what is the story behind this picture. I had no idea such ducks exist. Wonderful titale, I''m laughing all the time :)<br/> <br/>Next time you are there try it again (better cropping and quality) and make a print :) I would love to buy it for my children or for my friend as a gift :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-10 18:47:50.</i></td>', 'I came back to check what is the story behind this picture. I had no idea such ducks exist. Wonderful titale, I''m laughing all the time :) Next time you are there try it again (better cropping and quality) and make a print :) I would love to buy it for my children or for my friend as a gift :)', '2004-11-10 18:47:29.000000', '2004-11-10 18:47:50.000000', 0),
