(1006895, 117838, 26849, '<td valign="top">For those concerned, this goose does not seem to suffer from this birth defect. It behaves like all the other geese at the park. It doesn''t even walk around saying "woe is me" ;) <br/> <br/>This goose is wild but stays at the park lake because lots of people feed them. <br/> <br/>The pose is actually the goose just walking and looking on the ground for food to eat.<br/> <br/>I liked this pose from all the others because it appears to be dancing the twist.<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the comments.<br/> <br/></td>', 'For those concerned, this goose does not seem to suffer from this birth defect. It behaves like all the other geese at the park. It doesn''t even walk around saying "woe is me" ;)  This goose is wild but stays at the park lake because lots of people feed them.  The pose is actually the goose just walking and looking on the ground for food to eat. I liked this pose from all the others because it appears to be dancing the twist. Thanks for all the comments. ', '2004-11-11 23:09:23.000000', NULL, 0),
