(1077640, 117909, 18191, '<td valign="top">Very good exposure here... I am glad that the sky is not blown out and that there foreground is not terribly underexposed. I wonder what over-exposing by 2/3 a stop would have done. Nice view worth a reshoot.</td>', 'Very good exposure here... I am glad that the sky is not blown out and that there foreground is not terribly underexposed. I wonder what over-exposing by 2/3 a stop would have done. Nice view worth a reshoot.', '2004-12-26 08:37:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1082308, 117909, 10047, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape. I might have cropped higher or lower to put the horizon at the 1/3 line (rule of thirds). Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape. I might have cropped higher or lower to put the horizon at the 1/3 line (rule of thirds). Well done.', '2004-12-29 20:43:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1094239, 117375, 10658, '<td valign="top">This really should''ve been rated higher.  If I''d voted on this challenge I would''ve definitely given this photo at least an 8.  I keep running across it randomly and it always makes me look twice :)  Good shock value!</td>', 'This really should''ve been rated higher.  If I''d voted on this challenge I would''ve definitely given this photo at least an 8.  I keep running across it randomly and it always makes me look twice :)  Good shock value!', '2005-01-06 04:26:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1095871, 117428, 12332, '<td valign="top">I like this subject and your composition and focus are great.  I think it suffered a little because the light was so diffuse and lacking shadow.  Getting that right is tough to do unless you''re in a studio setup or something like it.  Nice job.  (I don''t get why some people would think gourds aren''t bizarre!)</td>', 'I like this subject and your composition and focus are great.  I think it suffered a little because the light was so diffuse and lacking shadow.  Getting that right is tough to do unless you''re in a studio setup or something like it.  Nice job.  (I don''t get why some people would think gourds aren''t bizarre!)', '2005-01-07 13:25:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1098804, 116520, 29404, '<td valign="top">the light is more than amazing...wonderfull wonderfull light..the composition and subject is very inviting to the eyes to keep going through the shot for ever...where u got that gret shot?trhis is for far is one of the best 4 shots i had ever seen on that site...amazing what talent can do to blease her owner and the otheres....congrats on ur talent</td>', 'the light is more than amazing...wonderfull wonderfull light..the composition and subject is very inviting to the eyes to keep going through the shot for ever...where u got that gret shot?trhis is for far is one of the best 4 shots i had ever seen on that site...amazing what talent can do to blease her owner and the otheres....congrats on ur talent', '2005-01-09 21:32:47.000000', NULL, 0),
