(1238344, 117931, 35217, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent macro shot! Anyone who thinks you should have used a tripod clearly doesn''t take macro shots.. it''s called depth of field.. and you have captured it!</td>', 'This is an excellent macro shot! Anyone who thinks you should have used a tripod clearly doesn''t take macro shots.. it''s called depth of field.. and you have captured it!', '2005-03-20 02:03:55.000000', NULL, 0),
