(1329453, 117909, 2560, '<td valign="top">You could have used less sky. As a general rule try to leave the sky out of your photos unless it is pretty and blue or dramatic.  <br/> <br/>I think if you try a longer lens and create a more clear subject this could be a great shot.<br/> <br/>Tim</td>', 'You could have used less sky. As a general rule try to leave the sky out of your photos unless it is pretty and blue or dramatic.   I think if you try a longer lens and create a more clear subject this could be a great shot. Tim', '2005-04-26 19:34:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1347901, 116512, 30817, '<td valign="top">It IS a Sumac plant. Different from Poison Sumac, this one grows on small tree-like bushes and color changes are radical after first frost. Leaves generally fall off soon after their unnatural brillance flourishes. I used to live in Ohio and have a few shots like this.</td>', 'It IS a Sumac plant. Different from Poison Sumac, this one grows on small tree-like bushes and color changes are radical after first frost. Leaves generally fall off soon after their unnatural brillance flourishes. I used to live in Ohio and have a few shots like this.', '2005-04-30 21:43:40.000000', NULL, 0),
